No, those come probably from your Java bootstrap. However, you should have rJava/jri/JRI.jar - if that is missing then you're in trouble. If in doubt, re-install rJava and make sour you have fairly recent Java version. YOu also get class not found errors when the classes compiled with more recent JVM than the one you're using.

Cheers,
Simon


